# Error Handling Pattern

Enforces transaction-safe error handling with consistent patterns. Services handle business errors, routes handle HTTP errors.

## When to Apply

Apply this rule when:
- Writing error handling code
- Creating execution records
- Handling exceptions
- Need transaction safety

